      "excerpt": "Xabi Alonso's Chelsea tenure starts with a thrilling 3-2 win over Fulham. Get the latest insights and betting angles for African punters.",
      "body": "# Chelsea Kick Off Alonso Era with Win Over Fulham\n\nEish, massive news for Premier League fans! Xabi Alonso\u2019s Chelsea tenure has started on a high note with a thrilling 3-2 win over Fulham, as reported by *Independent Sport* and *Sporting News*. The Blues\u2019 record signing, Morgan Rogers, bagged a debut goal, while Cole Palmer also starred in this end-to-end London derby. This is the kind of squad news that typically moves Chelsea\u2019s season-long odds\u2014compare the current live odds on SifuFinds before betting, since prices shift fast.\n\n## Alonso\u2019s Blues Show Promise in Attack\n\nXabi Alonso\u2019s first game in charge of Chelsea was a rollercoaster, with both teams showcasing attacking flair but leaving much to be desired defensively. Fulham vs Chelsea ended 3-2 in favor of the Blues, thanks to goals from Rogers and Palmer. *Independent Sport* gave Rogers an 8/10 rating for his debut performance, while a certain problem player scored a disappointing 4/10. This is the kind of form that bettors across Africa will be watching closely, especially those using platforms like Bet9ja and Sportybet.\n\n## Premier League Power Rankings Shake-Up\n\nAccording to *CBS Sports*, Chelsea\u2019s strong start under Alonso has already made waves in the Premier League power rankings. Meanwhile, Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur had a woeful opening round, setting the stage for an unpredictable season. African punters should keep an eye on these early shifts, as they could impact long-term betting markets. For instance, Chelsea\u2019s title odds might shorten if their form continues\u2014compare markets across Betway and Hollywoodbets to find the best value.\n\n## Betting Angle: Fulham vs Chelsea Aftermath\n\nThis match is a prime example of why in-play betting is so popular among African bettors. The game\u2019s end-to-end nature would have kept live bettors on the edge of their seats. If you missed out, don\u2019t worry\u2014SifuFinds has you covered with live odds from top bookmakers like 1xBet and Melbet. Whether you\u2019re backing Chelsea\u2019s title charge or Fulham\u2019s fight for survival, now\u2019s the time to compare odds and find the best deals.\n\n## Responsible Gambling\n\nWhile the excitement of the Premier League is undeniable, it\u2019s crucial to bet responsibly. Set a budget, stick to it, and never chase losses. Remember, betting should be fun, not stressful. If you\u2019re in Nigeria, Kenya, South Africa, Ghana, or Tanzania, make sure to use trusted payment methods like M-Pesa, MTN MoMo, OPay, or PalmPay for secure transactions.\n\nFor the latest odds and expert insights, visit SifuFinds. We\u2019re Africa\u2019s #1 betting comparison website, helping you make informed decisions every step of the way.\n\n*18+ | Bet Responsibly | T&Cs Apply*",
